  "details": "This bug was reported in open beta, but was not fixed before the beta got pushed to live:\n\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/785-non-humanoid-keyframes-in-custom-movement-animations-not-synced\n\nAs of build 785, custom walking animations for humanoid avatars no longer work fully. Any keyframe that isn't moving a humanoid bone isn't synced. For example, I have an avatar that turns off and on a couple of game objects every time I start moving. Locally, it still appears to work, but no one else see the game objects change state.\n\nwhat other people see:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=99p4t94TwIk\n\nwhat I see:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/491433028288249888/584289354948542485/2019-06-01_01-53-42.mp4",
